{"additions":2,"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## v0.16.0\n\n- #185 — Projects: `projects-filter \"<expression>\"` stacks a filter on every view (saved or local); `is:open` / `is:closed` / `is:merged` are evaluated (the board fetch reads the content state); `x` hides closed issues and merged / closed PRs, `projects-hide-closed \"on\"` starts that way\n- #186 — GitHub: `x` on the issue / PR list brings closed issues and merged / closed PRs into both lists (dimmed, no GraphQL points), `github-show-closed \"on\"` starts that way\n- #187 — Projects: `projects-roadmap { start \"-7d\"; zoom \"month\" }` says where a Roadmap view opens and at which scale; a local view's `roadmap { … }` overrides it\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w\n","changedFiles":2,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-10T08:17:03Z","deletions":2,"headRefName":"release/0.16.0","labels":[],"number":191,"reviewDecision":"","reviewRequests":[],"reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABM9V7BQ","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe changes are limited to a straightforward version bump in the manifest and lockfile with no functional code modifications.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nBumps the crate version to v0.16.0 to publish a new release of `vig` (Rust TUI cockpit) without altering runtime behavior.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Update `vig` package version from `0.15.0` → `0.16.0` in `Cargo.toml`\n- Sync the lockfile’s `vig` package entry to `0.16.0`\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| Cargo.toml | Updates the crate version to 0.16.0 for the release. |\r\n| Cargo.lock | Updates the lockfile’s `vig` package version to match 0.16.0. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 1/2 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-09-10T08:18:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"c12da8e25893d6ca6a15286fc0734bc0c082b936"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-10T08:21:32Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34454328565/job/102797077444","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-10T08:17:10Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-10T08:17:54Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34454328466/job/102797076801","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-09-10T08:17:10Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-10T08:29:05Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34455385987/job/102800447897","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-09-10T08:28:56Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-10T08:20:17Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34454328565/job/102797077191","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-09-10T08:17:12Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowN